  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Keep Girls in School an initiative by P&amp;G - Whisper and UNESCO New Del</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO New Delhi and Whisper&#xae;?, have come together to raise awareness and educate on Menstrual Health and Hygiene Management under the programme #KeepGirlsInSchool. The total budget for the project is $167,702. Under this Project a total of 5 teaching and learning modules have been developed on vrious thematic areas : MHHM Curriculum from Early Childhood to Tertiary Education, MHHM Teacher Training Curriculum, MHHM and Gender, MHHM and Nutrition, Health and Hygiene, MHHM and Girls with Disabilities; and A Gap Analysis Report. These draft Modules, will be edited and printed in the coming six months. There is also an ongoing Survey and a Thesaurus of Terminology being developed.</narrative>
  </description>
